  message: "Code sites, read while stamping resolved_by (PR #2389): objc.py ~1043 local_methods[selector] holds ONE method per selector for the whole file, last writer, whatever the receiver; ~1089 with defer_bare_method_call(suffix): a send to ANY receiver binds the enclosing class's method of that selector. [super m] binding the own class's m was not checked (see the java super item WI-mapas)."  # 261a
